    </div><div class=3D"para" id=3D"para-46" data-idx=3D"46">
      <span class=3D"para-idx">46</span>
      <h4>Counterarguing against attack</h4>
<p>Counterarguing against the attack was measured with five items adopted f=
rom Niederdeppe et al. (2015) on a 7-point agreement scale (e.g., "I felt l=
ike I wanted to 'argue back' with what was being said in the article";  <mj=
