g/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>=CE=B1</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-contain=
er>  =3D .92).</p>

    </div><div class=3D"para" id=3D"para-47" data-idx=3D"47">
      <span class=3D"para-idx">47</span>
      <h4>Perceived efficacy</h4>
<p>Perceived efficacy was measured after Phase 1 and Phase 2 message exposu=
re with four items from the Risk Behavior Diagnosis Scale (Witte et al., 20=
01), adapted for the cancer prevention context. The scale assessed self-eff=
icacy and response efficacy on 7-point agreement scales ( <mjx-container cl=
