l></mjx-container>  =3D .93), and transportation with three items (e.g., "I=
 could picture myself dealing with the situations described in the article"=
;  <mjx-container class=3D"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0" jax=3D"CHTML" tabin=
dex=3D"0" ctxtmenu_counter=3D"10" style=3D"font-size: 119.2%; position: rel=
