    </div><div class=3D"para" id=3D"para-50" data-idx=3D"50">
      <span class=3D"para-idx">50</span>
      <h4>Issue involvement</h4>
<p>Following prior inoculation research (e.g., Ivanov et al., 2009), issue =
involvement was measured before Phase 1 message exposure and included as a =
covariate. Because it can shape resistance and counterarguing (Pfau et al.,=
 2004), controlling for its baseline level helps isolate inoculation effect=
s. Participants rated six semantic differential items in response to the pr=
ompt</p>

    </div><div class=3D"para" id=3D"para-51" data-idx=3D"51">
      <span class=3D"para-idx">51</span>
      <p>"To me, cancer prevention is ..." on a 7-point scale (e.g., 1 =3D =
unimportant, 7 =3D important). Reliability was  <mjx-container class=3D"Mat=
hJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0" jax=3D"CHTML" tabindex=3D"0" ctxtmenu_counter=3D"=
